WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.125
In verse 14.17,

2
00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:34.041
Lord Krishna is explaining

3
00:00:34.041 --> 00:00:35.333
how the results of actions performed

4
00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:39.000
under the three gunas –
sattva, rajas, and tamas –

5
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.375
differ from one another,

6
00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:43.416
and which inner forces

7
00:00:43.416 --> 00:00:45.875
are active behind them.

8
00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:52.958
When a person acts in sattva Guna,

9
00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:54.416
knowledge and clarity arise

10
00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:57.666
within them spontaneously.

11
00:00:57.666 --> 00:00:58.416
This knowledge

12
00:00:58.416 --> 00:01:00.083
is not merely the gathering

13
00:01:00.083 --> 00:01:01.791
of facts,

14
00:01:01.791 --> 00:01:05.000
but a means of establishing deep harmony

15
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.166
with reality.

16
00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:09.208
This knowledge

17
00:01:09.208 --> 00:01:11.208
brings peace to the mind,

18
00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:13.666
makes decisions balanced,

19
00:01:13.666 --> 00:01:15.875
and gives the capacity

20
00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.083
to see things

21
00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:20.875
as they truly are.

22
00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:22.875
On the other hand, when actions

23
00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:24.875
are driven by Rajo Guna,

24
00:01:24.875 --> 00:01:26.166
the result is

25
00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:30.000
greed and endless desires.

26
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.958
The mind becomes restless –

27
00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:35.666
always craving more.

28
00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:38.000
Even if material success is achieved,

29
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.666
contentment does not follow.

30
00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:44.291
This guna intensifies thirst further and
binds the soul

31
00:01:44.291 --> 00:01:46.000
in constant struggle

32
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.166
and distress.

33
00:01:49.166 --> 00:01:50.208
And when actions

34
00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:52.958
are performed under the influence
of Tamo Guna,

35
00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:54.250
the result is

36
00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:58.625
ignorance, laziness, and carelessness.

37
00:01:58.625 --> 00:02:00.166
In this state, a person

38
00:02:00.166 --> 00:02:01.916
remains unaware of the consequences

39
00:02:01.916 --> 00:02:03.250
of their actions

40
00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:07.083
and begins to behave foolishly.

41
00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:08.500
As a result

42
00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.250
they fall deeper into darkness.

43
00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:13.500
Lord Krishna says –

44
00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.125
if through

45
00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:17.583
spiritual practice

46
00:02:17.583 --> 00:02:22.000
a person nourishes sattva Guna,
they can gradually

47
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.583
overcome rajas and tamas.

48
00:02:24.583 --> 00:02:28.041
By connecting with divine knowledge and living

49
00:02:28.041 --> 00:02:31.708
with a spirit of devotion, these bondages
can be crossed.

50
00:02:31.708 --> 00:02:35.500
Only then is it possible to move toward

51
00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:38.083
true joy and liberation.

52
00:02:42.791 --> 00:02:47.875
Let Me tell you something important
about the gunas –

53
00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:49.250
Listen -

54
00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:53.416
When you act in sattva Guna,

55
00:02:53.416 --> 00:02:56.875
I fill your heart with true

56
00:02:56.875 --> 00:02:58.875
knowledge.

57
00:02:58.875 --> 00:02:59.583
This knowledge

58
00:02:59.583 --> 00:03:01.750
is not mere information –

59
00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:04.208
it is clarity.

60
00:03:04.208 --> 00:03:08.458
That clarity teaches you how to respond

61
00:03:08.458 --> 00:03:11.750
with wisdom, how to live with gentleness,

62
00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.791
how to pause and reflect

63
00:03:13.791 --> 00:03:17.000
before reacting.

64
00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.833
This sattva makes you aware

65
00:03:19.833 --> 00:03:22.833
of what is truly valuable –

66
00:03:22.833 --> 00:03:26.666
not just what feels good for a moment.

67
00:03:26.666 --> 00:03:30.041
But when Rajo Guna takes over,

68
00:03:30.041 --> 00:03:33.041
your vision becomes clouded.

69
00:03:33.041 --> 00:03:35.500
You run after desires,

70
00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:40.333
and one desire fulfilled gives birth to another.

71
00:03:40.333 --> 00:03:43.416
You mistake craving for clarity –

72
00:03:43.416 --> 00:03:44.541
and that craving

73
00:03:44.541 --> 00:03:47.125
keeps you perpetually unstable.

74
00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:50.500
And when the influence of Tamo Guna grows,

75
00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:54.583
you stop asking questions altogether.

76
00:03:54.583 --> 00:03:57.833
You drift along –

77
00:03:57.833 --> 00:04:01.041
without even knowing you are drifting –

78
00:04:01.041 --> 00:04:03.708
and accept that very drifting

79
00:04:03.708 --> 00:04:05.666
as peace.

80
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:08.875
So ask yourself –

81
00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:13.000
which guna are you nurturing today?

82
00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.625
If you want lasting knowledge,

83
00:04:15.625 --> 00:04:18.166
nourish sattva.

84
00:04:18.166 --> 00:04:21.375
Choose food, words,

85
00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:24.750
thoughts, and actions

86
00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.375
that lift you –

87
00:04:27.375 --> 00:04:28.791
not merely excite you.

88
00:04:28.791 --> 00:04:29.583
Then knowledge

89
00:04:29.583 --> 00:04:32.833
will not only be stored in your mind –

90
00:04:32.833 --> 00:04:37.208
it will shape the path of your life.

91
00:04:37.208 --> 00:04:38.208
Reflect on this.

92
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:47.708
If you want a wise and alert child,

93
00:04:47.708 --> 00:04:49.208
begin with bringing

94
00:04:49.208 --> 00:04:53.875
positive change to the atmosphere at home.

95
00:04:53.875 --> 00:04:54.791
Because children

96
00:04:54.791 --> 00:04:57.791
do not only listen to our words –

97
00:04:57.791 --> 00:05:00.458
they also learn from how we live.

98
00:05:00.458 --> 00:05:02.541
Sattva gives rise to knowledge.

99
00:05:02.541 --> 00:05:05.291
But that knowledge does not arrive suddenly –

100
00:05:05.291 --> 00:05:09.333
it grows through small, daily decisions.

101
00:05:09.333 --> 00:05:12.541
What food do we serve at home?

102
00:05:12.541 --> 00:05:15.958
What conversations fill the rooms?

103
00:05:15.958 --> 00:05:17.666
What kind of activities do we pursue

104
00:05:17.666 --> 00:05:20.791
in the name of entertainment?

105
00:05:20.791 --> 00:05:23.750
These may seem ordinary,

106
00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:27.916
but they leave a deep impression
on a child’s mind.

107
00:05:27.916 --> 00:05:32.416
Think about this – if the elders in the home

108
00:05:32.416 --> 00:05:34.666
are absorbed all day in screens

109
00:05:34.666 --> 00:05:37.416
or external distractions,

110
00:05:37.416 --> 00:05:40.833
children will naturally imitate them.

111
00:05:40.833 --> 00:05:44.125
If the home atmosphere is filled
with harsh words,

112
00:05:44.125 --> 00:05:45.708
unnecessary indulgence,

113
00:05:45.708 --> 00:05:48.458
or restless energy,

114
00:05:48.458 --> 00:05:51.166
then Rajo Guna or Tamo Guna

115
00:05:51.166 --> 00:05:54.416
will grow naturally in the child.

116
00:05:54.416 --> 00:05:57.875
But if the home is calm, conversations

117
00:05:57.875 --> 00:06:00.875
are clear and respectful,

118
00:06:00.875 --> 00:06:03.750
food is simple and pure,

119
00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:07.625
and there is space for spiritual discussion –

120
00:06:07.625 --> 00:06:09.208
that atmosphere

121
00:06:09.208 --> 00:06:13.541
will naturally invite sattva Guna.

122
00:06:13.541 --> 00:06:17.791
So do not wait for a school

123
00:06:17.791 --> 00:06:21.000
or society to give the child knowledge.

124
00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:25.250
Make your own home the foundation
of that education.

125
00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:28.083
Create an environment

126
00:06:28.083 --> 00:06:29.500
where sattva

127
00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.583
can grow naturally.

128
00:06:31.583 --> 00:06:32.666
Because

129
00:06:32.666 --> 00:06:35.791
wise children are not born ready –

130
00:06:35.791 --> 00:06:39.666
they are shaped in the atmosphere of a home

131
00:06:39.666 --> 00:06:43.583
that nourishes right thinking.

132
00:06:43.583 --> 00:06:44.500
Reflect on this.

133
00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:51.416
Have you seen someone

134
00:06:51.416 --> 00:06:53.416
at the workplace

135
00:06:53.416 --> 00:06:56.250
who appears intensely ambitious –

136
00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:58.000
always busy,

137
00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.500
always chasing the next

138
00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:02.000
big target?

139
00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.500
From the outside, this looks impressive.

140
00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:10.291
But within – is this peace, or pressure?

141
00:07:10.291 --> 00:07:13.166
When Rajo Guna is dominant,

142
00:07:13.166 --> 00:07:16.833
it manifests as greed.

143
00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:21.000
But it is not the kind of greed that makes noise.

144
00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.833
It comes dressed up –

145
00:07:23.833 --> 00:07:25.500
speaking the language of professionalism,

146
00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.208
winning awards.

147
00:07:27.208 --> 00:07:29.416
This greed hides behind words

148
00:07:29.416 --> 00:07:30.500
like ‘targets,’

149
00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:34.875
‘growth,’ ‘expansion’ – but within

150
00:07:34.875 --> 00:07:36.666
fills a person with restlessness.

151
00:07:36.666 --> 00:07:39.250
Never letting them feel satisfied,

152
00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:42.666
always driving them to want more.

153
00:07:42.666 --> 00:07:46.875
Look around – the moment most people

154
00:07:46.875 --> 00:07:47.833
finish studying

155
00:07:47.833 --> 00:07:52.041
and choose a job, they chase the package

156
00:07:52.041 --> 00:07:53.208
and forget

157
00:07:53.208 --> 00:07:56.291
job satisfaction.

158
00:07:56.291 --> 00:07:58.500
Submerged in work day and night,

159
00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:02.916
they drift away from life’s simple joys.

160
00:08:02.916 --> 00:08:06.500
The result – lifestyle ailments like
high blood pressure,

161
00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:09.625
diabetes, and more.

162
00:08:09.625 --> 00:08:11.333
And the most troubling thing

163
00:08:11.333 --> 00:08:16.000
is that this problem is not visible.

164
00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:19.125
It looks like success.

165
00:08:19.125 --> 00:08:23.666
But I want you to look within.

166
00:08:23.666 --> 00:08:25.833
Ask yourself –

167
00:08:25.833 --> 00:08:30.000
is my ambition coming from purpose,

168
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.583
or from pressure?

169
00:08:31.583 --> 00:08:35.375
Is my drive nourished by clarity –

170
00:08:35.375 --> 00:08:37.291
or only by comparison?

171
00:08:37.291 --> 00:08:39.625
Do not let rajas-driven ambition

172
00:08:39.625 --> 00:08:42.791
become a cycle

173
00:08:42.791 --> 00:08:47.083
where peace itself feels like laziness.

174
00:08:47.083 --> 00:08:48.000
Balance your goals

175
00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:51.000
with sattva –

176
00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.541
with awareness, values,

177
00:08:54.541 --> 00:08:57.125
and a spirit of service.

178
00:08:57.125 --> 00:08:59.416
True professional life is not only

179
00:08:59.416 --> 00:09:02.958
about what you achieved,

180
00:09:02.958 --> 00:09:07.250
but also about how calm and clear you remained

181
00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:11.458
while achieving it.

182
00:09:11.458 --> 00:09:14.166
This is true yoga-vision –

183
00:09:14.166 --> 00:09:16.083
where goals are met

184
00:09:16.083 --> 00:09:19.708
and the mind stays at peace.

185
00:09:19.708 --> 00:09:20.791
Reflect on this.
